---
subject: {{#if testMode}}[TEST] {{/if}}{{productName}} renews on {{date}}
preheader: Your subscription renews soon.
buttonLabel: Pay now
buttonUrl: {{payUrl}}
footer: You are receiving this e-mail because of an order at {{storeName}}.
---
{{#if testMode}}
<table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:0.5rem;background-color:rgb(254,243,199);padding:8px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:rgb(146,64,14)">TEST ORDER - no real payment was made</p></td></tr></tbody></table>
{{/if}}
<h2 style="text-align:center">Your subscription renews soon</h2>
<p>Hi {{username}},</p>
{{#if manual}}
<p>Your subscription to {{productName}} at {{storeName}} ends on {{date}}. Please pay {{amount}} before then to keep it.</p>
{{else}}
<p>Your subscription to {{productName}} at {{storeName}} renews on {{date}}. We will charge {{amount}} then.</p>
{{#if paymentMethod}}
<p>It will be charged to: {{paymentMethod}}.</p>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
<table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:0.5rem;background-color:rgb(249,250,251);padding:16px"><tbody>
<tr><td style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(106,114,130)">Product</td> <td align="right" style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(31,41,55)">{{productName}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(106,114,130)">Renews on</td> <td align="right" style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(31,41,55)">{{date}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(106,114,130)">Amount</td> <td align="right" style="padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(31,41,55)">{{amount}}</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
{{#if manageUrl}}<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:8px 0 16px 0;text-align:center"><a href="{{manageUrl}}" style="color:rgb(54,65,83)" target="_blank">Manage subscription</a></p>{{/if}}
